---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
import BookIntro from '../components/BookIntro.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
  title="Directed Edges / Nathan Curtis"
  description="Nathan started Directed Edges to serve his clients and community practicing design systems. He's passionate about information architecture, statistics and UX design."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-start mb-8">
      <img src={`${base}/images/nathan-curtis.jpg`} alt="Nathan Curtis" class="w-28 h-28 rounded-full object-cover shrink-0" />
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-2">Nathan Curtis</h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Design system consultant</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-4">
      Nathan wrote <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Modular-Web-Design-Components-Documentation/dp/0321601351">the book on modular design</a> before "design systems" had a name. In the 20 years since, he's embedded in 100+ systems as leader, architect, designer, developer, and product owner&mdash;building the technical foundations and operational muscle that make systems durable. His <a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/">writing</a> has reached 2M+ readers. His <a href="https://www.specsplugin.com">tools</a> turn component definitions into structured data for humans and machines. Previously he led <a href="https://www.curious-squid.com/">EightShapes</a> with Dan Brown (2006&ndash;2024).
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-4">
      If your system needs to deliver more value as your organization moves toward AI-driven product development, Nathan can help you get there.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 mb-4">
      <BookIntro />
    </div>

    <!-- Experience (SKETCH) -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <SectionLabel label="Experience" />

      <!-- Stats row -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold">20+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">years in design systems</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold">100+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">design systems consulted</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold">100+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">conference talks and workshops</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold">2</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Clarity conference emcee (2018, 2022)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tiered clients -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Led the program <span class="font-normal text-muted">(9+ months as embedded leader or architect)</span></h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-1 text-sm mb-6">
          <p>Morningstar</p>
          <p>Verizon</p>
          <p>Cisco</p>
          <p>Marriott</p>
          <p>Discovery</p>
          <p>Credit Karma</p>
          <p>Fidelity</p>
          <p>Capital One</p>
          <p>IDEXX</p>
          <p>NetApp</p>
          <p>Sun</p>
          <p>Expedia</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Advised or consulted on projects</h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-1 text-sm">
          <p>Google</p>
          <p>Salesforce</p>
          <p>Target</p>
          <p>ServiceNow</p>
          <p>REI</p>
          <p>Chase</p>
          <p>eBay</p>
          <p>Twitter</p>
          <p>Yahoo</p>
          <p>Wells Fargo</p>
          <p>Liberty Mutual</p>
          <p>Automattic</p>
          <p>Nationwide</p>
          <p>Dropbox</p>
          <p>Atlassian</p>
          <p>Ancestry</p>
          <p>Hudl</p>
          <p>Faire</p>
          <p>Citi</p>
          <p>FCS America</p>
          <p>Paylocity</p>
          <p>Software AG</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Skills</h4>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border">Leader</span>
          <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border">Architect</span>
          <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border">Designer</span>
          <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border">Developer</span>
          <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border">Product Owner</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Blog -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <SectionLabel label="Blog" />
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Nathan has written about design systems since 2015, with over 2 million reads on <a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/">Substack</a> and <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis">Medium</a>.</p>

      <p class="text-muted mb-3">Greatest hits:</p>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
          <a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/naming-tokens-in-design-systems-9e86c7444676" class="shrink-0">
            <img src={`${base}/images/writing-naming-tokens.png`} alt="Naming Tokens in Design Systems" class="w-32 sm:w-48 aspect-video object-cover rounded shadow-sm" />
          </a>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/naming-tokens-in-design-systems-9e86c7444676">Naming Tokens in Design Systems</a></h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-1">Terms, Types, and Taxonomy to Describe Visual Style</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted">2020 &middot; 304,000 reads</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
          <a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/the-fallacy-of-federated-design-systems-23b9a9a05542" class="shrink-0">
            <img src={`${base}/images/writing-federated-fallacy.png`} alt="The Fallacy of Federated Design Systems" class="w-32 sm:w-48 rounded shadow-sm" />
          </a>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/the-fallacy-of-federated-design-systems-23b9a9a05542">The Fallacy of Federated Design Systems</a></h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-1">Avoid the damage and distress of glorifying the wrong model</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted">2024 &middot; 20,000 views</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
          <a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/space-in-design-systems-188bcbae0d62" class="shrink-0">
            <img src={`${base}/images/writing-space.png`} alt="Space in Design Systems" class="w-32 sm:w-48 rounded shadow-sm" />
          </a>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://nathanacurtis.substack.com/p/space-in-design-systems-188bcbae0d62">Space in Design Systems</a></h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-1">From Basics to Expanded Concepts to Apply Space with Intent</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted">2016 &middot; 17,700 claps from 3,500 people</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Book -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <SectionLabel label="Book" />
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Modular-Web-Design-Components-Documentation/dp/0321601351" class="shrink-0">
          <img src={`${base}/images/modular-web-design.png`} alt="Modular Web Design book cover" class="w-32 sm:w-48 rounded shadow-sm" />
        </a>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Modular-Web-Design-Components-Documentation/dp/0321601351">Modular Web Design</a></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-2">2009</p>
          <p class="text-muted">A design systems book before &ldquo;design systems.&rdquo; It elaborates on component architecture, how to build libraries and create component and pattern docs using tools of the day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tools -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <SectionLabel label="Tools" />
      <p class="text-muted mb-6">Nathan has been making and sharing useful design systems tools with community since 2006. Remember EightShapes Unify, the InDesign design docs and specs templates? How about those Adobe Illustrator keyboard shortcuts?</p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Recent tools include:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="https://www.specsplugin.com">Specs</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma plugin</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1077953882260191737/visual-difference">Visual difference</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma plugin</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://contrast-grid.eightshapes.com/">Contrast grid</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Web app</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Appearances -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <SectionLabel label="Appearances" />

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Workshops</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">Design tokens &amp; UI component architecture</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Conceive, build and support a scalable architecture of configurable and composable design tokens and UI components for a durable library that stands the test of time.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">Design system planning and process</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Scope, plan and run processes to make features, deliver releases, tackle complex initiatives, and guide an organization through a major new generation of an entire library.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Recent talks</h3>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2026</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://smashingconf.com/amsterdam-2026/schedule#day4">Components as Data for Humans and Machines</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; SmashingConf, Amsterdam, 2026</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2025</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pAnrocPfFEo">Spectacular Slots</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma Schema, San Francisco, CA, 2025</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2024</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://smashingconf.com/antwerp-2024/schedule">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; SmashingConf, Antwerp, Belgium, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://smashingconf.com/ny-2024/schedule">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; SmashingConf, New York, NY, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://zeroheight.com/events/converge/home/">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Converge by ZeroHeight, Brighton, UK, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.intodesignsystems.com/">Designing and Automating Component Specifications</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Into Design Systems, Online, May 2024</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2023</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://webexpo.net/blog/make-designers-fall-in-love-with-your-design-system/">How to make and share more flexible UI components</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; WebExpo, Prague, CZ, April 2023</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2022</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NiDoqI_ZhvY">Architecting subcomponents</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma Schema, New York, NY, November 2022</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
